#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "报纸风格的极简中文博客块主题。首页全量移植 Broadside 报纸版面（报头三件套、三栏头条、本期要目），文章页保持 Typora Newsprint 阅读体验；英文内容采用 Broadside 字体方案（Source Serif 4 / Libre Caslon / Unifraktur）。全部模板区块化，色板/字体/间距由 theme.json 提供，站点编辑器所见即所得。内置 KaTeX、Mermaid、代码高亮按需加载与一键复制 Markdown。零外部请求。"
msgstr "A minimalist newspaper-style block theme for text-first blogs. The front page ports the Broadside newspaper layout in full (masthead trio, three-column leads, Inside This Edition); article pages keep the Typora Newsprint reading experience, and English content uses the Broadside font stack (Source Serif 4 / Libre Caslon / Unifraktur). Every template is block-based, with palette, typography and spacing provided by theme.json and WYSIWYG editing in the Site Editor. Built-in KaTeX, Mermaid, on-demand code highlighting and one-click Markdown copy. Zero external requests."

