#: inc/ads.php:272
msgid "留空 = 只显示占位。填入的内容按受信管理员内容原样输出（不做标记清洗）；脚本的注入方式由站点自行决定，主题不代注入。各端占位框比例即该端预留高度（占位 ↔ 广告 ↔ 清理回占位零跳动），请填与框规格一致的固定尺寸单元以避免布局跳动。"
msgstr "Leave empty to show only the placeholder. Content is output as trusted-administrator markup (no tag sanitizing); script injection is the site's responsibility — the theme does not inject it. Each device's placeholder box ratio is that device's reserved height (placeholder ↔ ad ↔ fallback: zero layout shift), so use fixed-size units matching the box to avoid layout jumps."

