msgstr "The about-page skeleton: a media-text intro with the avatar on the right plus a year-by-year timeline. Intro and timeline are placeholder copy for the site owner to replace. (Per the site owner's 0.10.4 decision the wide badge section was removed; rebuild it from the Button Wall pattern if needed.)"

