msgstr "2024 —— Switched to the current newspaper theme."

#: patterns/about-profile.php:43
msgid "2026 —— 仍在路上。（整组不需要可直接删除）"
msgstr "2026 —— Still on the road. (Delete the whole group if you don't need it.)"

#: patterns/ad-band.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "广告位 · 首页横幅"
msgstr "Ad slot · Front-page banner"

#: patterns/ad-band.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "首页横幅广告位（订阅栏与本期要目之间）：出厂占位，后台「外观 → 广告位」填码后输出受信代码。未启用槽位时整块不输出。"
msgstr "The front-page banner ad slot (between the Subscribe bar and Inside This Edition): ships as a placeholder and outputs trusted code once filled under Appearance → Ad Slots. Nothing is output while the slot is disabled."

#: patterns/ad-bottom.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "广告位 · 文章页读者来信上方"
msgstr "Ad slot · Article, above Letters"

#: patterns/ad-bottom.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "三端均输出在「读者来信」上方，宽度一律与文章尾双规线一致（正文栏自适应）；可分端开关与独立跳转链接。出厂占位，后台填码后输出受信代码。"
msgstr "Output above the Letters section on all devices, width matching the article-footer double rule (responsive); per-device toggles and a separate link. Ships as a placeholder and outputs trusted code once filled."

#: patterns/ad-rail.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "广告位 · 文章页侧栏（方形，桌面端专属）"
msgstr "Ad slot · Article sidebar (square, desktop only)"

#: patterns/ad-rail.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "仅桌面端（≥1240px）固定于右栏：有悬浮目录时贴其下方（整体较目录右移），未开启时替代目录位；手机/平板不输出，页末位由「读者来信上方」槽位承担。出厂占位，后台填码后输出受信代码。"
msgstr "Desktop only (≥1240px), fixed in the right rail: beneath the floating TOC when it is on (offset further right), replacing its spot when off; not rendered on mobile or tablet, where the above-Letters slot covers the page end. Ships as a placeholder and outputs trusted code once filled."

#: patterns/article-footer.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "文章尾（标签 / 上下篇）"
msgstr "Article footer (tags / prev and next)"

#: patterns/article-footer.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "双规线之下：标签与上下篇导航。「复制 MD」按钮在文章头的署名行右侧。"
msgstr "Under the double rule: tags and prev/next navigation. The Copy MD button sits at the right of the article-header byline."

#: patterns/article-footer.php:17
#: patterns/article-footer.php:18
msgid "上下篇"
msgstr "Prev / next"

#: patterns/article-footer.php:19
msgid "较新一篇"
msgstr "Newer post"

#: patterns/article-footer.php:20
msgid "较早一篇"
msgstr "Older post"

#: patterns/article-header.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "文章头（眉题 / 标题 / 署名行 + 复制 MD）"
msgstr "Article header (kicker / title / byline + Copy MD)"

#: patterns/article-header.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Typora Newsprint 文章头：分类眉题、底线标题，署名行（日期 · 作者 · 阅读时间）右侧带浅色「复制 MD」小按钮；署名行下方为特色题图（无图自动不输出，0.10.4 站长反馈补）。"
msgstr "The Typora Newsprint article header: category kicker, ruled title, byline (date · author · reading time) with a light Copy MD button on the right; the featured image sits below the byline (omitted automatically when absent — added per the site owner's 0.10.4 feedback)."

#: patterns/article-header.php:32
msgid "复制 MD"
msgstr "Copy MD"

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "88×31 按钮墙（我的按钮 + 交换墙）"
msgstr "88×31 button wall (my buttons + exchange wall)"

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "复古 88×31 按钮文化两件套：上方「我的按钮」展示站长自荐按钮并附供他站复制的 HTML 片段；下方「按钮墙」收纳交换所得的友站按钮。尺寸由主题 CSS 锁死（88×31 + pixelated），GIF 原样输出。"
msgstr "A two-part tribute to vintage 88×31 buttons: My Buttons on top shows the owner's own badges with an HTML snippet other sites can copy; the Button Wall below collects badges received in exchange. Sizes are locked by the theme CSS (88×31 + pixelated); GIFs are output as-is."

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:14
#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:15
#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:16
#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:17
msgid "示例站点"
msgstr "Sample site"

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:24
msgid "我的按钮 · My Buttons"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:30
msgid "示例站点 · clouds"
msgstr "Sample site · clouds"

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:34
msgid "示例站点 · dynamic"
msgstr "Sample site · dynamic"

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:38
msgid "示例站点 · cyberpunk"
msgstr "Sample site · cyberpunk"

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:42
msgid "示例站点 · fire"
msgstr "Sample site · fire"

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:48
msgid "以下为本地抽象占位按钮，链接指向本站首页。公开交换前，请替换为已获授权的站点按钮，并更新图片地址和替代文字："
msgstr "These are local abstract placeholder buttons linking to this site's front page. Before exchanging publicly, replace them with authorized site buttons and update the image URLs and alt text:"

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:60
msgid "按钮墙 · Button Wall"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/buttons-wall.php:64
msgid "与友站交换所得的 88×31 按钮收藏在此，按交换先后排列。"
msgstr "88×31 badges received from partner sites are collected here, in exchange order."

#: patterns/comments.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "读者来信（评论区）"
msgstr "Letters (comments)"

#: patterns/comments.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "极简评论区：来信标题、评论列表（头像 / 作者 / 日期 / 正文 / 回复）、分页、评论表单。"
msgstr "A minimal comments section: a letters heading, the comment list (avatar / author / date / body / reply), pagination and the comment form."

#: patterns/lead-trio.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "三栏头条（简报栏 | 主稿 | 侧栏）"
msgstr "Lead trio (briefs | main story | sidebar)"

#: patterns/lead-trio.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Broadside 报纸头版三栏：左栏近日简报（4 篇）、中栏题图压底主稿（最新 1 篇，正文 10 段/2200 字先到为准，首字下沉双栏）、右栏 4:5 题图侧栏（固定第 6 篇，offset=5）。"
msgstr "The Broadside front-page three columns: Latest Briefs on the left (4 posts), a lead story with full-bleed art in the middle (latest post, capped at 10 paragraphs or 2,200 characters, drop-cap two-column), and a 4:5 art sidebar on the right (fixed 6th post, offset=5)."

#: patterns/lead-trio.php:18
msgid "近日简报"
msgstr "Latest Briefs"

#: patterns/lead-trio.php:47
msgid "长读 · The Long Read"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/lead-trio.php:77
msgid "读这篇文章 →"
msgstr "Read the story →"

#: patterns/not-found.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "更正启事（404）"
msgstr "Corrections notice (404)"

#: patterns/not-found.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "报纸「更正启事」风格的 404：说明、返回头版链接、检索框。"
msgstr "A newspaper corrections-notice 404: an explanation, a link back to the front page and a search box."

#: patterns/not-found.php:19
msgid "更正：您要找的版面不存在，或已被撤稿。"
msgstr "Correction: the page you are looking for does not exist, or has been withdrawn."

#: patterns/not-found.php:23
msgid "← 返回头版"
msgstr "← Back to the front page"

#: patterns/not-found.php:28
msgid "检索"
msgstr "Search"

#: patterns/not-found.php:28
msgid "检索本刊…"
msgstr "Search the paper…"

#: patterns/post-list.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "规线清单（归档 / 检索 / 索引）"
msgstr "Ruled list (archive / search / index)"

#: patterns/post-list.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "日期在左、标题与摘要在右的规线清单，继承当前查询（归档、检索、博客索引通用），含分页与空结果提示。"
msgstr "A ruled list with dates on the left and titles and excerpts on the right; it inherits the current query (archives, search and the blog index) with pagination and an empty-state note."

#: patterns/post-list.php:31
msgid "« 较新"
msgstr "« Newer"

#: patterns/post-list.php:32
msgid "较早 »"
msgstr "Older »"

#: patterns/post-list.php:39
msgid "本版暂无稿目"
msgstr "Nothing on this page yet"

#: patterns/post-list.php:43
msgid "该版面下还没有文章，换个关键词或分类试试。"
msgstr "No posts on this page yet — try another keyword or category."

#: patterns/sections.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "本期要目（分类框线网格）"
msgstr "Inside This Edition (boxed category grid)"

#: patterns/sections.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "「本期要目」：按分类分块的框线网格，每块列出该分类最新 3 篇。分类由主题自动按最近更新排序并排除「未分类」；在「分类查询」区块里手动勾选分类可覆盖。"
msgstr "Inside This Edition: a boxed grid grouped by category, each box listing that category's 3 latest posts. Categories are ordered automatically by recent updates, excluding Uncategorized; manually ticking categories in the Category Query block overrides this."

#: patterns/sections.php:14
msgid "本期要目 · Inside This Edition"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/subscribe.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "订阅框（墨底 RSS / llms.txt）"
msgstr "Subscribe box (ink RSS / llms.txt)"

#: patterns/subscribe.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Broadside newsletter 框改造：墨底双规线，左侧眉题 / 标题 / 说明，右侧 RSS 与 llms.txt 按钮。"
msgstr "A Broadside newsletter box reworked: ink background with double rules, kicker / title / note on the left, RSS and llms.txt buttons on the right."

#: patterns/subscribe.php:17
msgid "订阅 · Subscribe"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/subscribe.php:21
msgid "订阅本刊"
msgstr "Subscribe to this paper"

#: patterns/subscribe.php:25
msgid "RSS 可用任意阅读器订阅；llms.txt 为机器读者而设，AI 可循此索引取阅全刊。"
msgstr "Subscribe via RSS in any reader; llms.txt serves machine readers — AI can follow this index to read the whole paper."

#: patterns/subscribe.php:33
msgid "RSS 订阅"
msgstr "RSS feed"

